{
  "name": "Text Tools",
  "description": "Convert naming styles and letter case, sort and dedupe lines, and count words and reading time",
  "help": [
    "All three tools share the input on the left; everything is processed locally in Rust.",
    "Case conversion works line by line and shows 13 naming styles at once; click the end of a row to copy it.",
    "Line options apply in order: trim → remove empty → dedupe → sort → reverse → shuffle → numbering and prefix / suffix.",
    "CJK characters count as words and emoji as one character; reading time assumes 220 English words or 400 CJK characters per minute."
  ],
